iladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Xohishiga ko‘ra</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="12%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="48%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.1pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="12%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="48%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.1pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Ariza beruvchilarning ijtimoiy holati va muammolarini keys-menejment usulidan foydalangan holda aniqlaydi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Uch ish kunida</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="48%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.1pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Keys-menejment natijasida oilani “Temir daftar”ga kiritish bo‘yicha xulosa qilinganda, tavsiyanoma shakllantiriladi va ko‘rib chiqish uchun “mahalla yettiligi”ga kiritadi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Bir ish kunida</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="12%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="48%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.1pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="12%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Mahalla yettiligi”</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="48%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.1pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Ko‘rib chiqadi va tegishli qaror qabul qiladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Uch ish kunida</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="48%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.1pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Qabul qilingan qaror to‘g‘risida fuqaroni xabardor qiladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Bir ish kunida</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6974749"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6974755">Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2024-yil 31-maydagi 313-son <a href="-http://cli.lex.uz/ld/lps/doc/6973951">qaroriga</a> <br />3-ILOVA </a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6974756">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga kiritilayotgan o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6974757"></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974758">1. Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2021-yil 9-avgustdagi 504-son qarori bilan tasdiqlangan Rivojlanishda orqada qolayotgan hamda ishsizlik darajasi nisbatan yuqori bo‘lgan mahallalarda aholi bandligini ta’minlash orqali oilalarning daromad manbaini yaratish tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomning 6-bandi <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5562556?ONDATE=09.08.2021 00#-5565922">oltinchi xatboshisidan</a> “Saxovat va ko‘mak” jamg‘armasi va” so‘zlari chiqarib tashlansin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974759">2. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni ijtimoiy qo‘llab-quvvatlashga doir qo‘shimcha chora-tadbirlar to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 25-oktabrdagi 656-son <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154">qarorida</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974760">a) <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700053">3-band</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974762">“3. O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti huzuridagi Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi (keyingi o‘rinlarda — Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi) har yili 1-sentabrga qadar Davlat budjeti parametrlarida yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni uy-joy bilan ta’minlash uchun zarur mablag‘lar ajratilishini ta’minlash maqsadida Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligiga keyingi yil uchun uy-joyga muhtoj bo‘lgan yetim bolalar hamda ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlarni kiritib borsin”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974763">b) <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=10.08.2022 00#-6165808">6-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974764"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=10.08.2022 00#-6165808">birinchi xatboshi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974765">“6. Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi O‘zbekiston mahallalari uyushmasi hamda Oila va xotin-qizlar qo‘mitasi bilan birgalikda”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974766"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-6165813">“a” kichik bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974767"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-6165813">birinchi xatboshidagi</a> “mahalla fuqarolar yig‘inlari faollarining” so‘zlari “mahalla yettiligi” vakillarining” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974768"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=10.08.2022 00#-6165828">ikkinchi xatboshi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974769">“tashkil etilgan oilaviy bolalar uylarining ijtimoiy ahvoli, bolalarning oilaga moslashuvi, uy xo‘jaligini yuritish va ulardagi boshqa jamoaviy munosabatlarning shakllanishida mahalla fuqarolar yig‘ini raislari, mahalladagi ijtimoiy xodim va xotin-qizlar faollari doimiy ravishda ijtimoiy moslashuv monitoringini yuritish tizimini yo‘lga qo‘ysin”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974770">v) <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700073">7-band</a> o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974771">g) <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700081">1-ilovada</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974772"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700088">2-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974773"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=04.09.2023 00#-6595944">uchinchi</a> va <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700091">to‘rtinchi xatboshilar</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974774">“ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bola — ota-onalik huquqidan mahrum qilinganligi, bedarak yo‘qolgan yoki muomalaga layoqatsiz deb topilganligi, bolani tarbiyalashdan yoki uning huquq va manfaatlarini himoya qilishdan bo‘yin tovlaganligi, shu jumladan, uzrsiz sabablarga ko‘ra o‘z bolasini tug‘uruqxona yoki boshqa davolash muassasasidan, tarbiya, aholini ijtimoiy himoyalash muassasasi va shunga o‘xshash boshqa muassasalardan olishdan bosh tortganligi, tashlab (qoldirib) ketilgan yoki topib olinganligi sababli ota-onasi noma’lum bo‘lgan, yolg‘iz (ota) ona vafot etgan ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bola;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974775">uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bola va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bola — o‘zlariga biriktirilgan turar joyga ega bo‘lmagan va merosxo‘r va mol-mulkka egalik qilishning boshqa shakllari bilan nomida uy-joy bo‘lmagan Mehribonlik uylari, “SOS — O‘zbekiston bolalar mahallalari” uyushmasining Bolalarni muqobil parvarish qilish xizmatlari, homiylik, oilaga tarbiyaga (patronat) berilgan, oilaviy bolalar uylari (keyingi o‘rinlarda — muqobil joylashtirish shakllari) yoki Respublika o‘quv-tarbiya muassasalarida (keyingi o‘rinda — o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasi) tarbiyalangan 18 yoshga to‘lgan yetim va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan shaxslar”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974776"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700094">yettinchi xatboshi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974777">“onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimi — O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti huzuridagi Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi (keyingi o‘rinlarda — Agentlik) tomonidan yuritiladigan axborot tizimiga kiritilgan uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar bazasi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974778">quyidagi mazmundagi 3<sup>1</sup>-band bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974780">“3<sup>1</sup>. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga uy-joy ular muqobil joylashtirish shakllariga yoki o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasiga yuborilgan hududdan sotib olinadi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974779"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700097">4-band</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974782">“4. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga uy-joylar Agentlikning Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar boshqarmalari (keyingi o‘rinlarda — hududiy boshqarmalar) tomonidan:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974783">a) ko‘chmas mulkning birlamchi bozoridagi qurilgan ko‘p kvartirali uylardagi turar joylar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974784">b) ko‘chmas mulkning ikkilamchi bozoridagi qurilgan ko‘p kvartirali uylardagi turar joylar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974785">v) belgilangan narx doirasida yakka tartibdagi turar joy sotib olinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974786">Mazkur bandning “b” va “v” kichik bandlarida nazarda tutilgan uy-joylar qonunchilikka muvofiq belgilangan narxlar doirasida hududiy “Xalqparvar” komissiyalari xulosasiga hamda uy-joylarni baholash natijalariga asosan xarid qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974788">Bunda:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974791">uy-joyga muhtoj yetim va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar hokimliklari tomonidan Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari tomonidan xarid qilingan uylar hisobidan ajratiladi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974793">uy-joyga muhtoj yetim va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga ko‘chmas mulkning ikkilamchi bozoridagi qurilgan ko‘p kvartirali uylardagi turar joylar yoki yakka tartibdagi turar joy xarid qilinganda, uning narxi shu hududdagi ko‘chmas mulkning birlamchi bozoridagi qurilgan ko‘p kvartirali uylardan umumiy maydoni 25 kvadrat metrdan kam bo‘lmagan 1 xonali, voyaga yetgan yetim bolalar o‘rtasida nikoh tuzilgan hollarda esa, 50 kvadrat metrdan kam bo‘lmagan 2 xonali kvartiralar narxidan oshmasligi hamda qonunchilikda belgilangan tartibda baholovchi tashkilot tomonidan baholangan bo‘lishi lozim”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974797"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700101">7-banddagi</a> “Bolalarni himoya qilish masalalari kotibiyati (keyingi o‘rinlarda — kotibiyat)” so‘zlari “va Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974801"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700102">8 — 11-bandlar</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974804">“8. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni muqobil joylashtirish shakllariga berishda, ularning yashash joyi bo‘yicha uy-joyini bolada saqlab qolish kafolati belgilanadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974805">9. Biriktirilgan uy-joyga ega bo‘lgan yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida va o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasida bo‘lgan to‘liq davrda, shuningdek, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Qurolli Kuchlarida xizmatni o‘tash davrida yoki ozodlikdan mahrum qilish tariqasidagi jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida bo‘lgan davrida uy-joyga bo‘lgan huquqini saqlab qoladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974809">10. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni muqobil joylashtirish shakllariga berishda yoki o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasida tarbiyalanayotgan davrida ota-onalar yoki boshqa shaxslar tomonidan sotib yuborilishi yoki boshqacha tarzda begonalashtirilishi natijasida bolalar mavjud uy-joydan mahrum bo‘lgan holat aniqlangan taqdirda, Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari yoki bolaning qonuniy vakillari bitimni haqiqiy emas deb topish uchun sudga da’vo arizasi bilan murojaat qilishlari shart.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974811">11. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar ro‘yxatida turganida yoki biriktirilgan uy-joyga ega bo‘lganida, ularning yoshi 23 yoshdan katta bo‘lmagan davrda, ta’lim muassasalarida, ijtimoiy uylarida, muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida bo‘lgan yoki o‘quv-tarbiya muassasida bo‘lgan to‘liq davrda, shuningdek, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Qurolli Kuchlarida xizmatni o‘tash yoki ozodlikdan mahrum qilish tariqasidagi jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida bo‘lgan davrida meros bo‘yicha hamda davlat tomonidan beriladigan uy-joy olishga va uni saqlab qolishga bo‘lgan huquqini saqlab qoladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974815"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700119">13 — 17-bandlar</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974819">“13. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida bo‘lish muddatining tugashidan bir yil oldin yoki shu muddatda “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari tomonidan ularning qonuniy vakillari bilan birgalikda mazkur Nizomning 12-bandida ko‘rsatilgan holatlar mavjudligini o‘rganadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974823">Agar mazkur Nizomning 12-bandida ko‘rsatilgan holatlarning biri yoki bir nechtasi mavjud bo‘lgan taqdirda, “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar yoki ularning qonuniy vakillari bilan birgalikda yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolani o‘z hisobida saqlab turilgan uy-joyiga qaytib borishining imkoni yo‘q deb topish hamda uni “onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimiga kiritish masalasini ko‘rib chiqish uchun Agentlikning tegishli hududiy boshqarmalariga murojaat qiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974827">14. Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlarining yashash joyi bo‘yicha o‘z hisobida saqlab turilgan uy-joyga qaytib borishiga to‘sqinlik qiladigan holatlar mavjudligi to‘g‘risidagi murojaatni 10 ish kuni davomida ko‘rib chiqadi va asoslantirilgan xulosa qabul qiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974828">15. Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari tomonidan yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarda, ilgari unga band qilingan uy-joyga qaytib borishiga imkon bermaydigan yoki maqsadga muvofiq bo‘lmagan holatlar mavjudligi to‘g‘risida ijobiy xulosasi mavjud bo‘lganda (muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida bo‘lish yoki o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasida muddatining tugashiga qadar), “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari ularni “onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimiga kiritadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974833">16. “Onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimiga muqobil joylashtirish shakllariga olingan yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari tomonidan kiritib boriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974836">17. “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari “onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimiga kiritilgan uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar haqidagi barcha tegishli ma’lumotlar bazasini shakllantiradi, saqlaydi, ma’lumotlarni doimiy yangilab boradi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974841">“Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari zarur hollarda, uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga tegishli ma’lumotlarni uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar va ularning qonuniy vakillaridan so‘rab oladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974845">18-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700124">birinchi xatboshisi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974848">“18. “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni ular muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida bo‘lish hamda o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasida tarbiyalanishi muddatining tugashidan bir yil avval uy-joyga muhtojlar sifatida “onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimiga kiritadi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974851"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700129">19-banddagi</a> “kotibiyatlar” so‘zi “Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974854"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700133">21-banddagi</a> “Kotibiyat” so‘zi “Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmasi” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974858"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700135">23-banddagi</a> “Xalq ta’limi vazirligi” so‘zlari “ustidan nazorat Agentlik” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974861"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700137">24-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974863">quyidagi mazmundagi <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700138">ikkinchi xatboshi</a> bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974867">“Agarda 18 yoshga to‘lgan uy-joyga muhtoj yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasini tugatmagan hollarda, ushbu toifadagi bolalar o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasini tugatgan yilda uy-joy bilan ta’minlanadi.”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974870"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700138">ikkinchi</a> va <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700139">uchinchi xatboshilar</a> tegishincha uchinchi va to‘rtinchi xatboshilar deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974874">25-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700141">ikkinchi xatboshisi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974879">“Bunda yetim bola yoki ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolaning asoslantirilgan murojaati asosida Agentlik hududiy boshqarmalari tomonidan uy-joyning umumiy maydonini kengaytirish va mazkur bandda nazarda tutilgan talablarni saqlab qolish sharti bilan sotishga ruxsat beriladi”</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974882"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700148">28-banddagi</a> “Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar hokimliklari Bolalarni himoya qilish masalalari kotibiyati” so‘zlari “Agentlik” so‘zi bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974886"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700149">29-banddagi</a> “Xalq ta’limi vazirligi” so‘zlari “Agentlik” so‘zi bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974889"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700152">31-band</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974892">“31. Davlat budjeti parametrlarida Agentlik uchun ajratilgan mablag‘lar tarkibida alohida satrda mablag‘lar rejalashtirilib, keyinchalik haqiqiy talabdan kelib chiqqan holda Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalariga qayta taqsimlash orqali yo‘naltiriladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974895"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700153">32-band</a> o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974899"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700154">33-band</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974902">“33. Ushbu mablag‘lar Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari tomonidan belgilangan tartibda oldi-sotdi shartnomasiga asosan uy-joyni balansda saqlovchining hisobraqamiga yoki uy-joy egasining bank omonat hisobraqamiga hamda qurilish pudrat tashkiloti hisobraqamiga pul o‘tkazish yo‘li bilan o‘tkazib beriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974905">Bunda:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974909">ta’mirlash va jihozlash bilan bog‘liq xarajatlar tegishli tuman (shahar) mahalliy budjetining qo‘shimcha manbalari, “Mehr daftari” jamg‘armasi va Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligining Ijtimoiy himoya davlat jamg‘armasi hisobidan;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974911">uy-joyni baholash va unga bo‘lgan huquqlarni rasmiylashtirish bilan bog‘liq xarajatlar mazkur Nizomning 31-bandida belgilangan mablag‘lar hisobidan qoplanadi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974915">34-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700157">birinchi xatboshisi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974920">“34. Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari uy-joy berish to‘g‘risidagi qarorini (buyruqni) qabul qiladi va tuman (shahar) hokimligiga yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga ushbu Nizomga 2-ilovada belgilangan namunadagi orderni berish uchun yuboradi. Bunda tuman (shahar) hokimligi qaror (buyruq) kelib tushgan kundan boshlab bir ish kunida yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarga orderni rasmiylashtiradi va Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalariga yuborilishini ta’minlaydi. Mazkur order berilgan uy-joyga ko‘chib kirish uchun asos hisoblanadi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974923">quyidagi mazmundagi 34<sup>1</sup>-band bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974927">“34<sup>1</sup>. Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari tuman (shahar) hokimligi tomonidan order rasmiylashtirib berilgandan so‘ng 5 ish kuni mobaynida ushbu uy-joyni yetim bola va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolaga belgilangan tartibda rasmiylashtirib berilishini ta’minlaydi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6976478">39-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700164">birinchi xatboshisidagi</a> “, rasmiylashtirilgan sanadan boshlab o‘n yil muddatga” so‘zlari “va 30 yoshga to‘lguniga qadar” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974982"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700168">41-banddagi</a> “Tuman (shahar) hokimliklari” so‘zlari “Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974987"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700169">42-band</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974991">“42. Yetim bola yoki ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bola u muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida bo‘lish yoki o‘quv-tarbiya muassasasida tarbiyalanish muddatining tugayotgan yilning oxiriga qadar bo‘lgan muddatda uy-joylar bilan ta’minlanadilar, ushbu nizomning 9-bandidagi holatlar bundan mustasno”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6974995"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700170">43-banddagi</a> “Tuman (shahar) hokimliklari” so‘zlari “Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975000"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700172">45-banddagi</a> “tuman (shahar) hokimliklari bolalarni himoya qilish shu’balari” so‘zlari “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975006"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700173">46</a> va <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700174">47-bandlar</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975008">“46. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolaning ajratilgan uy-joyda yashashi, ijtimoiy hayotga moslashishida qiyinchiliklar aniqlangan taqdirda, unga “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari va mahalla organi faollari bilan birgalikda ijtimoiy-psixologik yordam ko‘rsatiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975013">47. Uy-joyga muhtoj sifatida hisobga qo‘yilgan hamda uy-joy bilan ta’minlangan yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar to‘g‘risidagi yillik ma’lumotlar Agentlikning hududiy boshqarmalari Agentlikka va tuman (shahar) hokimliklari tomonidan Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar hokimliklariga hisobot yilidan keyingi yilning 20-yanvarigacha, o‘z navbatida, Agentlik va Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar hokimliklari tomonidan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Mahkamasi va Statistika agentligiga hisobot yilidan keyingi yilning 25-yanvarigacha taqdim etilishi lozim”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975020"><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700183">1</a> va <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700189">2-ilovalar</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6975030"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6975036">“Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni uy-joy bilan ta’minlash tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomga <br />1-ILOVA </a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6975040">Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni uy-joylar bilan ta’minlash</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6975043">SXEMASI</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6975046"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6975052"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="12%"><p align="center"><strong>Bosqichlar</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="17%"><p align="center"><strong>Subyektlar</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="41%"><p align="center"><strong>Mexanizm</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="20%"><p align="center"><strong>Muddatlar</strong></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="12%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="17%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="41%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="12%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="17%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Uquv-tarbiya muassasalari va “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlari</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="41%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.75pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni uy-joyga muhtoj sifatida “onlayn-navbat” axborot tizimiga kiritib boradi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="20%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Bolani muqobil joylashtirish shakllarida bo‘lish muddati tugashidan bir yil avval</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="12%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="17%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: