.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="41%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.75pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar uchun uy-joy topadi va baholanishini tashkil etadi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Yil davomida</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="41%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.75pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalar uchun belgilangan tartibda uy-joy sotib oladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Uy-joy baholangandan keyin besh kun ichida</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="41%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.75pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3. Uy-joy berish to‘g‘risida qaror (buyruq) qabul qiladi va tuman (shahar) hokimligiga yuboradi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3. Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bola 18 yoshga to‘lgan yilda</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="12%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PAD