T: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="17%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="13%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="4%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">41.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="31%"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Ayollar daftari”ga kiritilgan xotin-qizlarning sayohatlarini tashkil etish.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Hisob-kitobga ko‘ra</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Ayollar daftari” jamg‘armasi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="17%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Oila va xotin-qizlar qo‘mitasi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="13%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Xotin-qizlar faoli</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="4%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="31%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="17%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="13%"><p align="right"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">”</span><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975130">4. Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2022-yil 25-apreldagi 211-son qarori bilan tasdiqlangan Hududlarda aholi bilan o‘tkazilgan uchrashuvlar davomida bildirilgan takliflar va aholini uzoq yillardan buyon qiynab kelayotgan mavjud muammolarni tezkor bartaraf etishga qaratilgan hamda amaliy tadbirlarni o‘z ichiga olgan <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5984308?ONDATE=26.04.2022 00#-5985489">“Yo‘l xaritasining”</a> 4-pozitsiyasi chiqarib tashlansin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975131">5. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zgalar parvarishiga muhtoj shaxslarga ijtimoiy xizmat va yordam ko‘rsatishning sifat jihatidan yangi tizimini joriy etish to‘g‘risida” 2024-yil 11-martdagi 123-son qarorining 5-bandi <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-6834968?ONDATE=12.03.2024 01#-6836788">uchinchi xatboshisi</a> quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975132">“xizmatlarning narxi eng yaxshi tijoriy takliflar asosida shakllantiriladi”.</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6975133"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6975134">Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2024-yil 31-maydagi 313-son <a href="-http://cli.lex.uz/ld/lps/doc/6973951">qaroriga</a> <br />4-ILOVA </a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6975135">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblanayotgan ayrim hujjatlari</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6975136">RO‘YXATI</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6975137"></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975138">1. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Moddiy yordam va ko‘makka muhtoj oilalarni, xotin-qizlar va yoshlarni ijtimoiy qo‘llab-quvvatlash bo‘yicha qo‘shimcha chora-tadbirlar to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 28-apreldagi 250-son <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5398681">qarori</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975139">2. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritish to‘g‘risida (O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining “Yoshlarning tadbirkorlik faoliyatini qo‘llab-quvvatlash va bandligiga ko‘maklashish, ularni ijtimoiy himoya qilish hamda bo‘sh vaqtini mazmunli tashkil etishga oid qo‘shimcha chora-tadbirlar to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 20-apreldagi PF-6208-son Farmoni)” 2021-yil 23-iyuldagi 450-son qaroriga ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5521261?ONDATE=23.07.2021 00#-5529506">4-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975140">3. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Mahkamasining ijro etuvchi tuzilmasi takomillashtirilishi munosabati bilan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirishlar va qo‘shimcha kiritish, shuningdek, ba’zilarini o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblash to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 16-avgustdagi 524-son qaroriga 1-ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5586053?ONDATE=17.08.2021 00#-5593889">35-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975141">4. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritish to‘g‘risida (O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining “Zo‘rlik ishlatishdan jabr ko‘rgan xotin-qizlarni reabilitatsiya qilishga oid qo‘shimcha chora-tadbirlar to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 19-maydagi PQ-5116-son qarori)” 2021-yil 6-oktabrdagi 624-son qaroriga ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5670668?ONDATE=07.10.2021 00#-5674688">7-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975142">5. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Yetim bolalar va ota-ona qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan bolalarni ijtimoiy qo‘llab-quvvatlashga doir qo‘shimcha chora-tadbirlar to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 25-oktabrdagi 656-son qaroriga 2-ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5695154?ONDATE=26.10.2021 00#-5700328">18-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975143">6. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Xotin-qizlar muammolarini o‘rganish va hal etish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2022-yil 31-martdagi 145-son qarorining <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5932671?ONDATE=01.04.2022 00#-5933099">13-bandi</a> hamda qarorga <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5932671?ONDATE=01.04.2022 00#-5933813">4-ilova</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975144">7. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirishlar kiritish to‘g‘risida (O‘zbekiston Respublikasining “Normativ-huquqiy hujjatlar to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 20-apreldagi O‘RQ-682-son Qonuni)” 2022-yil 4-apreldagi 153-son qaroriga ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-5936929?ONDATE=05.04.2022 00#-5941586">1026-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975145">8. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Yoshlar muammolarini o‘rganish va hal etish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2022-yil 7-iyundagi 312-son qaroriga 4-ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-6051791?ONDATE=07.06.2022 00#-6057477">6-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975146">9. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Yer munosabatlarida tenglik va shaffoflikni ta’minlash, erga bo‘lgan huquqlarni ishonchli himoya qilish va ularni bozor aktiviga aylantirish tizimi takomillashtirilishi munosabati bilan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritish, shuningdek, ba’zilarini o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblash to‘g‘risida” 2022-yil 8-iyuldagi 375-son qaroriga 1-ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-6102472?ONDATE=08.07.2022 00#-6104039">27-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975147">10. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Oila va xotin-qizlar bilan ishlash, mahalla va nuroniylarni qo‘llab-quvvatlash tizimi takomillashtirilishi munosabati bilan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim hujjatlariga o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritish, shuningdek, ba’zilarini o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblash to‘g‘risida” 2022-yil 9-avgustdagi 438-son qaroriga 1-ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-6148240?ONDATE=10.08.2022 00#-6150210">79-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975148">11. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim hujjatlariga ijtimoiy ahvoli va turmush sharoiti og‘ir oilalarni qo‘llab-quvvatlash tizimini soddalashtirishga qaratilgan o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritish to‘g‘risida” 2023-yil 17-oktabrdagi 547-son <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-6638233">qarori</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975149">12. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Qishloq ho‘jaligiga mo‘ljallangan yer uchastkalarini ijaraga berish tartibi takomillashtirilganligi munosabati bilan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirishlar va qo‘shimcha kiritish to‘g‘risida” 2024-yil 26-apreldagi 237-son qaroriga ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-6899664?ONDATE=27.04.2024 00#-6902284">3-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6975150">13. Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2020-yil 22-apreldagi 213-F-son <a href="http://lex.uz/docs/-4795495">farmoyishi</a>.</a></div><br /><div class="PUBLICATION_ORIGIN"><label id="s1089"></label><a id="-6974189">(Qonunchilik ma’lumotlari milliy bazasi, 19.06.2024-y., 09/24/313/0426-son)</a></div></div>
</div>
</body>
